{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2022-03-10 07:30:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP SUCCESSION PLAN NAMING ROBIN VINCE CEO-ELECT', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MARCH 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON CORPORATION ("BNY MELLON") (NYSE: BK) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THOMAS P. (TODD) GIBBONS HAS DECIDED TO RETIRE AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND MEMBER OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS ON AUGUST 31, 2022, AFTER A DISTINGUISHED 36-YEAR CAREER WITH THE COMPANY.'}